---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Notes
eyebrow: Unfinished thinking
deck: Short entries, kept deliberately rough. Seedlings are first thoughts, budding notes are being worked on, evergreen notes are ones I would stand behind.
permalink: /notes/
---
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="key-h">
  <h2 class="eyebrow" id="key-h">Key</h2>
  <ul class="seedkey">
    <li><span class="seed seed--seedling">seedling</span> first thought, probably wrong</li>
    <li><span class="seed seed--budding">budding</span> being worked on</li>
    <li><span class="seed seed--evergreen">evergreen</span> refined, and I would defend it</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="notes-h">
  <h2 class="visually-hidden" id="notes-h">All notes</h2>
  <ul class="notegrid">
    {%- for n in collections.notes %}
    <li class="notecard">
      <p class="labelrow">
        <span class="seed seed--{{ n.data.status }}">{{ n.data.status }}</span>
        <span class="labelrow__sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <time datetime="{{ n.data.updated or n.data.date | iso }}">{{ n.data.updated or n.data.date | readable }}</time>
      </p>
      <h3 class="notecard__title"><a href="{{ n.url }}">{{ n.data.title }}</a></h3>
      <p class="notecard__desc">{{ n.data.description }}</p>
      {%- if n.data.tags %}
      <ul class="tags">{% for t in n.data.tags %}<li>{{ t }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
      {%- endif %}
    </li>
    {%- else %}
    <li class="empty">No notes yet.</li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
